    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635510/extras/fb430e0db5f81e9dc48e6d2ecd6e76c0.avif?t=1728298823\" width=600 height=914 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635510/extras/b2c04181432020e2698321493a3fd5b7.avif?t=1728298823\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><br>&quot;<strong>Raiders of Valhalla: Prologue</strong>&quot; is a free demo for &quot;<strong>Raiders of Valhalla</strong>&quot;. In this sneak peek, take charge of a fearless horde of Viking dwarves as they fight valiantly for Valhalla. Fulfill the divine mission bestowed upon you and gear up for epic battles, all while relishing the chance to immerse yourself in the action and strategy that awaits you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635510/extras/06d6a7401ef2b83bb1a37e491a8b9856.poster.avif?t=1728298823\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635510/extras/06d6a7401ef2b83bb1a37e491a8b9856.webm?t=1728298823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Unlock an extensive and diverse selection of equipment, ranging from humble to <strong>legendary</strong>, and enhance each piece to its utmost potential to harness unmatched power and capabilities<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635510/extras/6fe3c7816861799e046e158c2033ee2e.poster.avif?t=1728298823\" width=600 height=483 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635510/extras/6fe3c7816861799e046e158c2033ee2e.webm?t=1728298823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Build an army of dwarves with a diverse array of <strong>warrior classes</strong>, where warriors of the same class can provide group buffs, and each class possesses unique and distinct abilities that set them apart from one another!&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635510/extras/816f1190ab3784193e037a674a68cb93.poster.avif?t=1728298823\" width=600 height=375 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635510/extras/816f1190ab3784193e037a674a68cb93.webm?t=1728298823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Challenge and conquer mighty <strong>bosses of immense power</strong>! Defeating these formidable adversaries demands not only sheer strength but also fearless warriors and strategic mastery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635510/extras/636a63c07f3fc5fc5d9b163ef5770a96.poster.avif?t=1728298823\" width=600 height=181 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635510/extras/636a63c07f3fc5fc5d9b163ef5770a96.webm?t=1728298823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Conquer <strong>multiple villages</strong> nestled in incredibly wild locales! These villages come in <strong>different tiers</strong>, each offering varying challenges such as the number of enemies, formidable bosses, and unique regions to explore.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN FEATURES IN THIS DEMO:</h2>\u2022 Explore villages of varying levels and challenges.<br><br>\u2022 Build an army of dwarves with unique abilities.<br>\u2022 Upgrade equipment to strengthen your troops.<br>\u2022 Confront powerful bosses to earn rewards.<br>\u2022 Collect coins as loot after raids.<br>\u2022 Utilize synergy among warriors of the same class.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEE WHAT AWAITS YOU IN THE FULL GAME:</h2><strong>Core Gameplay Elements:</strong><br>\u2022 Dwarf Clan Management<br>\u2022 City Invasions<br>\u2022 Character Classes and Progression<br>\u2022 Tactical Challenges<br><br><strong>Mechanics and Strategy:</strong><br>\u2022 Special Abilities and Blessings<br>\u2022 Boss Battles<br>\u2022 Reinforcements and Battle Strategy<br>\u2022 Viking Ship<br><br><strong>Progression and Narrative:</strong><br>\u2022 Resource Gathering<br>\u2022 Progression Manager<br>\u2022 Story Integration<br><br><strong>Progression and Customization:</strong><br>\u2022 Equipment Enhancement<br>\u2022 Legendary Weapons<br>\u2022 Forge System<br>\u2022 Pet Companions<br>\u2022 Skill Tree Development<br><br><strong>And much more in the full game! Check the Raiders of Valhalla page on Steam!</strong>",
