to earn rewards.<br>\u2022 Collect coins as loot after raids.<br>\u2022 Utilize synergy among warriors of the same class.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEE WHAT AWAITS YOU IN THE FULL GAME:</h2><strong>Core Gameplay Elements:</strong><br>\u2022 Dwarf Clan Management<br>\u2022 City Invasions<br>\u2022 Character Classes and Progression<br>\u2022 Tactical Challenges<br><br><strong>Mechanics and Strategy:</strong><br>\u2022 Special Abilities and Blessings<br>\u2022 Boss Battles<br>\u2022 Reinforcements and Battle Strategy<br>\u2022 Viking Ship<br><br><strong>Progression and Narrative:</strong><br>\u2022 Resource Gathering<br>\u2022 Progression Manager<br>\u2022 Story Integration<br><br><strong>Progression and Customization:</strong><br>\u2022 Equipment Enhancement<br>\u2022 Legendary Weapons<br>\u2022 Forge System<br>\u2022 Pet Companions<br>\u2022 Skill Tree Development<br><br><strong>And much more in the full game! Check the Raiders of Valhalla page on Steam!</strong>",
